  "description": "🔹 Info 🔹\n\nThe Idle Bandits is a relaxed guild focused on steady progress over constant grinding. We value consistent participation and teamwork without putting pressure on our members. Play at your own pace, stay active when you can, and help the guild grow together.\n\n\n\n‎🔹 Requirements 🔹\n\nConsistency and a desire to have fun! if you&#039;re active, you&#039;re in! 🙌                                                     \n\n‎You must be in the guild discord to receive guild activity rewards  \n\nOne character per person (Unless there is an event and we have free space)\n\n\n\n\n\n🔹 Benefits/Services for all guild members ⚒️ just send Facecaker a DM\n\n       Forging level 71 ⚒️\n\n       Alchemy level 80 💎⚗️\n\n🔹Discord server with \n\n\nWorld Boss and Shrine Tier notifications\n\n\n\nTop Contributor Recognition Program \n\n\n\nGiveaways\n\n\n\n\n         https://discord.gg/ewwM7bDusB\n\n\n🔹 Raids\nEveryday schedule:\n\n                     Combat level 40:    2:00PM CT\n\n                     Combat level 60:    4:00PM CT\n\n\n🔹Top Contributor Recognition Program\n\n\nThe three highest-performing members, determined by guild contributions, deposits, and raid participation, will receive special rewards. Based on a market-value point system guild members will be rewarded points throughout the month on \n\n\n\n\n1000 gold = 1 point \n\n10000 gold = 10 points\n\nGuild raid participation = 25 points \n\n\n\n\n🥇 1 30-day membership pack  \n\n🥈 150k gold and 500 CGWS (Cooked Great White Shark)\n\n🥉 100k gold and 250 CGWS",
